---
title: Clear Dressing
author: Barbara Muirhead
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sugar{2.5%c}
@mustard{1/2%tsp}
@vinegar{1%c}
@salt{2.5%tsp}
@grated onion{3%T}
@celery seed{2%tsp}
@salad oil{1%c}

Boil sugar, mustard, vinegar, and salt for 1 minute. Cool and add grated onion, celery seed, and salad oil.
